# Bat Hunt (San d'Oria 1-2, mission.sandoria.bat_hunt), Endracion in Southern San d'Oria. A level 10 Warrior of San
# d'Oria with 1-1 completed (a GM), holding an Orcish Scale Mail and a Bat Fang (Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out).
# Section 1 (no current mission, a San d'Orian): Endracion's script plays 1009; its finish with option 1 does nothing;
# again, with option 101: begun (Southern San d'Oria's 1009; no message). Section 2 (1-2 current, status below 2):
# Endracion plays 1021. King Ranperre's Tomb: the Tombstone plays cutscene 4; its finish sets status 2; the Tombstone
# again (status 2): no section: its default. Section 3 (status 2): Endracion plays 1022. A Bat Fang traded, not
# completed before: his script's 1008 (no mission event); the Orcish Scale Mail traded: 1023, whose finish completes
# the mission (200 rank points) and takes the mail. Repeated (completed, begun again with option 101, status set to 2
# by a GM): the Orcish Scale Mail traded: 1008 (the repeat wants the Bat Fang); the Bat Fang traded: 1003, whose finish
# completes it again.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Endracion/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1003 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1023 KingRanperresTomb/Tombstone_Upper/onTrigger KingRanperresTomb/onEventFinish/4
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-108.5,1,-34 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
item OrcishMailScales
item BatFang
login
trigger Endracion                       # section 1: his script's 1009
finish option=1                         # not 101: nothing
trigger Endracion                       # 1009 again
finish option=101                       # 101: begun
trigger Endracion                       # section 2 (status 0): 1021
finish
warp 1,0.1,-101 KingRanperresTomb
trigger Tombstone_Upper                 # section 2: cutscene 4
finish                                  # status 2
trigger Tombstone_Upper                 # status 2: no section: its default
finish-if-event
warp -108.5,1,-34 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Endracion                       # section 3 (status 2): 1022
finish
walk -109.5,1,-34
trade Endracion BatFang x1              # not completed before: no match: his script's 1008
finish
trade Endracion OrcishMailScales x1     # 1023
finish                                  # completed (200 rank points); the mail taken
trigger Endracion                       # section 1: 1009
finish option=101                       # begun again
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
item OrcishMailScales
trade Endracion OrcishMailScales x1     # completed before wants the Bat Fang: his script's 1008
finish
trade Endracion BatFang x1              # 1003
finish                                  # completed again
